res originais.&#10;Escala logarítmica (asinh) só para exibição, para comparar valores de ordens de grandeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos fundos (1,05%).&#10;Um valor por fundo: a classe/série com mais meses publicados, na versão mais recente do informe (a mesma do gráfico ao lado).&#10;\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade × fundos FIDC</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rentabilidade mensal entre os fundos FIDC\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"43.0\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"3.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"17.8\" y=\"45.3\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"0.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"31.1\" y=\"45.0\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"1.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"44.4\" y=\"45.3\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"0.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"57.6\" y=\"45.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"0.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"70.8\" y=\"45.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"0.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"84.1\" y=\"45.2\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"0.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"97.3\" y=\"13.4\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"32.6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"44.7\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.3\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"123.8\" y=\"44.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"137.1\" y=\"41.7\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"4.3\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"150.3\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"163.6\" y=\"40.4\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"5.6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"176.8\" y=\"43.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"190.1\" y=\"45.0\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-r